 6. Refund mutations split by actor kind, not just role. Approval is an employee workflow (`refund_manager`); finalization is an owning-customer workflow. See [returns](returns.md).
 7. Dated/topic updates do not authorize actions by themselves. [policy_update_scan](policy_update_scan.md) only returns matched update semantics; the domain BP still applies identity, state, request, and tool gates.
 8. An OS/tooling workaround is permitted only for employee identities and only when a specific incident file under `/docs/...` documents it. The workaround does not change the underlying domain policy, answer format, or grounding rules. See [os_tooling_incidents](os_tooling_incidents.md).
